      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">7‑Layer Protective Packing &amp; Scratch Guard Film: Zero‑Damage Assurance for Packers and Movers Kolkata to Bangalore</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>The 7‑layer protective packing system is engineered to deliver a “zero‑damage” guarantee for every delicate item shipped. Each layer works in concert, adding a specific defense—against impact, vibration, moisture, temperature swings, static discharge, and surface abrasion—so that the final package can withstand the rigors of handling, stacking, and transportation.</p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Layer 1 – Primary Bubble Wrap (Polyethylene)</strong>: 3‑mm high‑density bubbles cushion the item against micro‑shocks and provide an initial barrier against punctures.</li>
  <li><strong>Layer 2 – Air‑Pillow Cushion (Polyethylene Foam)</strong>: 5‑mm thick pillows distribute weight evenly, absorbing sudden jostles during loading or unloading.</li>
  <li><strong>Layer 3 – Anti‑Static Foam (Polypropylene)</strong>: 2‑mm anti‑static foam prevents electrostatic buildup that could damage electronic components.</li>
  <li><strong>Layer 4 – Moisture‑Barrier Film (PE/Aluminum Laminate)</strong>: 0.5‑mm laminated film blocks humidity and condensation, protecting moisture‑sensitive items.</li>
  <li><strong>Layer 5 – Thermal Insulation Foam (Polyurethane)</strong>: 4‑mm foam maintains a stable internal temperature, shielding items from extreme heat or cold.</li>
  <li><strong>Layer 6 – Shock‑Absorbing Core (EVA Foam)</strong>: 6‑mm EVA core offers high resilience, converting impact forces into harmless deformation.</li>
  <li><strong>Layer 7 – Rigid Protective Shell (Polycarbonate)</strong>: 2‑mm polycarbonate shell resists crushing, provides structural integrity, and keeps the inner layers in place.</li>
</ul>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Each layer is bonded with a low‑viscosity, non‑adhesive sealant that prevents delamination during transit.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>The combination of micro‑bubble cushioning and macro‑shock absorption ensures that no single impact can reach the product.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Moisture and temperature layers keep the interior environment stable, while the anti‑static foam eliminates the risk of electrostatic discharge.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>The rigid shell acts as a fail‑safe, preventing collapse under heavy stacking.</span></li></ul>

<p>Complementing this system is the Scratch Guard Film: a 0.2‑mm high‑density polyethylene film applied over the outermost layer. Its ultra‑smooth surface eliminates abrasive contact with pallets, conveyors, and shipping containers, preventing scratches that could compromise the product’s finish or function. The film is UV‑stable and self‑cleaning, so it maintains clarity and protection throughout the shipment.</p>

