<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transport from Kolkata to Bangalore | Safe Two-Wheeler Shifting
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What factors determine the cost of bike transport from Kolkata to Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The final price depends on the bike’s make and model, its weight, the distance (approximately 1,500 km via NH 19), any special handling requirements, insurance coverage level, and the type of packaging selected. Seasonal demand and fuel surcharges may also influence the quote, but Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers provides a transparent breakdown so you know exactly what you’re paying for.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 7‑layer protective packing prevent scratches during the Kolkata‑Bangalore move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Each of the seven layers serves a specific purpose: heavy‑duty bubble wrap cushions impact, high‑density foam guards edges, corrugated fiberboard adds rigidity, stretch film seals against moisture, and custom wooden crates secure fragile parts. The final scratch‑guard film creates a barrier against abrasions. Together they absorb shocks, prevent vibration‑induced marks, and keep the bike pristine throughout the long haul.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance mandatory for two‑wheeler shifting and what does it cover?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">While not legally mandatory, insurance is strongly recommended and is included in our standard service package. Our IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covers 100 % declared value against accidental damage, theft, fire, or natural calamities during transit from Kolkata to Bangalore. Optional higher‑value coverage can be added for premium bikes, ensuring complete peace of mind.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike in real time during the transit from Kolkata to Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every dedicated covered truck is equipped with satellite‑GPS live tracking. Once your bike is loaded, you receive a unique tracking link that shows the vehicle’s exact location, estimated arrival time, and any route deviations. This real‑time visibility is part of our commitment to transparency for packers and movers kolkata to bangalore services.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the typical delivery time for bike relocation between Kolkata and Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Under normal traffic conditions, the bike is delivered within 3‑4 business days. This includes pickup, secure loading, overnight rests at our climate‑controlled depots, and final doorstep delivery in Bangalore. Unexpected road closures or extreme weather may add a day, but we keep you informed at every stage.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any restrictions on bike models or sizes for the hydraulic ramp trailers?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our hydraulic ramp trailers accommodate all standard two‑wheelers, including sport bikes, cruisers, and scooters up to 2.5 m in length and 200 kg in weight. Oversized or custom‑built motorcycles may require a dedicated container, which we can arrange at a marginally higher cost. Our team evaluates each bike during the quote phase to ensure a perfect fit.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
